idle-daemon (3.5.29-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Wayland presentation lifecycle freeze: hide presenter on stop and
    destroy existing overlays on output reconfiguration.
  * Correct CPU budget hard limit calculation over the evaluation window
    and reset budget upon plugin reload.
  * Support /etc/xdg/idlescreen/config.yaml for system config discovery.

 -- IdleScreen Maintainers <maintainers@idlescreen.dev>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

idle-daemon (3.5.20-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tiered perf promise: 17 inline `mod benches` blocks deleted and their
  * T1/T2 work re-homed into real `[[bench]]` targets (stretch, draw_frame,
  * and a new T2-only wayland-present hot_path).
  * Baseline pipeline now reads criterion's `estimates.json` instead of
  * scraped stdout, so a compare that finds nothing can no longer report
  * a pass. T1 regressions fail the build; the PR comment runs first.
  * `scripts/check-perf-labels.sh` fails CI on a false T1 claim.
  * Fixes: a deadlock in the overlay event-thread test (sync_channel(1)
  * with no receiver), and `cargo bench -p bursts --bench tick` panicking
  * on every grid because prepare_for_bench skipped skyline init.

 -- IdleScreen Maintainers <maintainers@idlescreen.dev>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:02:57 -0000

